// ---- green-task execution contexts ----
// The same shape as the Linux boundary: a Mach-O build has a direct stack switch (raw_switch), its
// readiness source is kqueue instead of epoll (rt_os_reactor_open/loop), and a task stack is a
// reservation whose lowest page is PROT_NONE. Parking uses __ulock_wait/__ulock_wake through
// operation 202.
