// ---- reactor: kqueue ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// kqueue is the readiness source: EVFILT_READ/EVFILT_WRITE one-shots carry the task to wake in
// udata, EVFILT_TIMER one-shots are the sleeps, and an EVFILT_USER event with ident 1 is the fence
// that makes the reactor complete a batch. A struct kevent is {ident, filter, flags, fflags, data,
// udata}: 32 bytes on both Mach-O targets, little-endian, with filter and flags adjacent at offset
// 8, which is why they are written together as one 32-bit word.
